OL,7,G2245 Long Lost Family: Born Without
OL,8,G     Trace
OL,9,     FIn August 1983, a newborn baby was
OL,10,     Ffound in a Leicester public phone
OL,11,     Fbox. Now 41 and a mother herself,
OL,12,     FSarah wants to know whether it was
OL,13,     Fher own mother who left her there,
OL,14,     Fand if so, why? Nicky Campbell and
OL,15,     FDavina McCall also investigate the
OL,16,     Fcase of a baby boy discovered in
OL,17,     F1960 on the second floor of a
OL,18,     Flocked London mansion block
