OL,5,G2345 The Assembly
OL,6,     FRapper Aitch faces autistic,
OL,7,     Fneurodivergent and
OL,8,     Flearning-disabled interviewers,
OL,9,     Fopening up about fame, identity
OL,10,     Fand the nuances of being white in
OL,11,     Fa typically black music genre. As
OL,12,     Fthe questions come thick and fast,
OL,13,     FAitch reflects on his lyrics and
OL,14,     Fthe language he used early in his
OL,15,     Fcareer, admitting he felt pressure
OL,16,     Fto say certain things as a young
OL,17,     Frapper - and that he got it wrong
