OL,5,G0350 Inside the Langham: Britain's
OL,6,G     First Grand Hotel
OL,7,     FThe hostelry's CEO arrives in
OL,8,     FLondon from head office in Hong
OL,9,     FKong to inspect one of the hotel's
OL,10,     Fmost ambitious renovations yet, a
OL,11,     Fvast new terrace added to one of
OL,12,     Fits most exclusive suites.
OL,13,     FMeanwhile, head bartender Giulia
OL,14,     Fteams up with executive chef
OL,15,     FBerwyn to spice up the menu in the
OL,16,     Fworld-famous Artesian bar. Maureen
OL,17,     FLipman narrates
