OL,5,G0535 Tom Kerridge Cooks Italy
OL,6,     FTom forages for truffles in Umbria
OL,7,     Fbefore discovering how the
OL,8,     FCampanian Plain has been a hotbed
OL,9,     Fof agricultural innovation for
OL,10,     Fthousands of years, something he
OL,11,     Fsees in today's precision herb
OL,12,     Ffarms. In a forest whose location
OL,13,     Fis a secret, he joins Alessandro
OL,14,     Fand his dogs Moretta and Nena on
OL,15,     Fthe hunt for black gold. Tom later
OL,16,     Fheads to the ancient ruins of
OL,17,     FPaestum, a city born out of
OL,18,     Fagricultural innovation
